<main class="lp-page belkins-callbox-page" id="simple-guide">
  <div class="lp-hero-shell"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <nav class="lp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">Outbound Sales Library</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">Belkins vs Callbox</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="lp-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Belkins vs <span>Callbox</span>
          <small>Pricing and B2B appointment setting</small>
        </h1>
        <p class="lp-intro">Start with the first three months of costs. Then check the contract length, calling coverage and who owns the follow-up.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions">
          <a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare prices <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="lp-text-link" href="#callteam">Watch how CallTeam works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="lp-brief" aria-labelledby="belkins-callbox-fit">
        <h2 id="belkins-callbox-fit">Which one fits?</h2>
        <dl class="bvc-verdict">
          <div><dt>Belkins</dt><dd>Run a managed campaign or buy a batch of meetings from email and LinkedIn.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Callbox</dt><dd>Add outreach teams when different markets or buyer groups need their own coverage.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>CallTeam</dt><dd>Hire a calling team to own the follow-up and qualify meetings for sales.</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-method">CallTeam publishes this comparison and provides managed calling. Prices checked <time datetime="{{ guide.checkedDate }}">{{ guide.checkedLabel }}</time>. <a href="#sources">See the sources.</a></p>
  </div></div>

  <nav class="lp-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <a href="#comparison">Price table</a>
    <a href="#budget">Budget examples</a>
    <a href="#callteam">CallTeam video</a>
    <a href="#quote">Compare quotes</a>
    <a href="#questions">FAQs</a>
  </div></nav>

  <section class="lp-section bvc-first" id="comparison"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Belkins vs Callbox pricing and scope</h2></div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="lp-table sg-table bvc-table" role="table">
        <caption>Published starting prices, outreach channels and contract terms</caption>
        <thead><tr role="row">
          <th scope="col" role="columnheader">What to compare</th>
          <th scope="col" role="columnheader">Belkins retainer</th>
          <th scope="col" role="columnheader">Belkins pay per appointment</th>
          <th scope="col" role="columnheader">Callbox</th>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Starting price</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins retainer"><strong>{{ prices.belkinsMonthly }} per month</strong></td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment"><strong>{{ prices.appointmentRate }} per appointment</strong> Add {{ prices.setupFee }} for setup. Minimum {{ prices.starterAppointments }} appointments.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox"><strong>{{ guide.podBudgets[0].monthly }} per month</strong> Estimate for one campaign pod.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Channels</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins retainer">Email and LinkedIn. Calling coverage varies by tier.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">Email and LinkedIn only. Belkins handles replies and booking.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox">Phone, email, LinkedIn and web retargeting.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Commitment</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins retainer">Belkins describes a six-month agreement with a checkpoint at month three.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">The package has a six-month delivery window from launch.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox">Monthly subscription pricing. Ask for the initial term and renewal conditions in writing.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Who runs it</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins retainer">A managed team for strategy, research, outreach and scheduling.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">One GTM specialist. Confirm when you can review results together.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox">Each pod has one sales development rep and a support team. A campaign manager oversees the work.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="sg-sources"><a href="{{ sources.belkinsManaged.url }}">Belkins managed service</a> · <a href="{{ sources.belkinsAppointments.url }}">Belkins meeting package</a> · <a href="{{ sources.callboxPricing.url }}">Callbox calculator and inclusions</a> · <a href="{{ sources.callboxFaq.url }}">Callbox pricing FAQ</a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="budget"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>What to budget for the first three months</h2>
      <p>These totals use the published starting rates before taxes and quoted extras. Confirm Belkins’ billing currency.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bvc-budgets">
      <article class="lp-pair-card">
        <h3>Belkins</h3>
        <dl class="bvc-cost-lines">
          <div><dt>Retainer, three monthly invoices</dt><dd>{{ prices.belkinsThreeMonths }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Retainer, six at the same rate</dt><dd>{{ prices.belkinsAgreementTotal }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Starter package, {{ prices.starterAppointments }} × {{ prices.appointmentRate }} + {{ prices.setupFee }}</dt><dd>{{ prices.starterTotal }}</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>The starter package works out to {{ prices.starterUnitCost }} per appointment with setup.</p>
        <p>Belkins Growth lists calls tied to buying signals. Growth Plus adds cold calling and voicemail. Ask for the tier price and what you can change at month three. <a href="{{ sources.belkinsPlans.url }}">Belkins plans</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-pair-card">
        <h3>Callbox</h3>
        <dl class="bvc-cost-lines">
          {% for budget in guide.podBudgets %}
          <div><dt>{{ budget.label }}, three monthly invoices</dt><dd>{{ budget.threeMonths }}</dd></div>
          {% endfor %}
          <div><dt>Two pods per month</dt><dd>{{ guide.podBudgets[1].monthly }}</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>Callbox says team size, languages and markets can change the quote.</p>
        <p>Belkins’ comparison cites a higher Callbox estimate. These examples use Callbox’s own current calculator. <a href="{{ sources.belkinsTerms.url }}">Belkins comparison</a> · <a href="{{ sources.callboxPricing.url }}">Callbox calculator</a>.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="callteam"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>When CallTeam is the better fit</h2>
      <p>Managed calling starts at <strong>{{ prices.callTeamMonthly }} per month</strong> when you have accounts ready to call. List research and data can be part of the quote. <a href="/pricing/">CallTeam pricing and scope</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-two bvc-proof">
      {{ processVideoInline('CallTeam’s calling process', 'See how we pick accounts, follow up and give sales the reason a buyer agreed to meet.', 'belkins-vs-callbox') }}
      <article class="lp-pair-card">
        <h3>18 meetings booked in 90 days</h3>
        <p>We asked finance buyers where outside analysts could help on live deals. The calls covered financial modelling, company comparisons and deal support.</p>
        <a href="/case-studies/financial-services-appointment-setting/">See the campaign and its results <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="bvc-process">
      <h3>From first dial to sales handoff</h3>
      <dl class="bvc-grid">
        <div><dt>Prepare the calls</dt><dd>We agree on who to reach, what to say and what qualifies a meeting. We can <a href="/ai-lead-generation-services/">build a fresh prospect list</a> and run the outreach as your <a href="/services/outsourced-sdr/">outsourced SDR team</a>.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Leave a reason to call back</dt><dd>When a call reaches a mailbox, we leave live voicemails or play approved voicemail drops. We log the attempt and schedule the next call. <a href="/articles/b2b-cold-call-voicemail-scripts-that-create-a-reason-to-call-back/">See voicemail script examples</a>.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Follow through and qualify</dt><dd>We handle callbacks and agreed email follow-up. Sales gets the buyer’s reason to meet and the next step. <a href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/">See how we manage appointments</a>.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p>Have old inquiries or stalled deals? <a href="/services/lead-reactivation/">Restart those conversations</a>. Opening a US market? <a href="/services/us-market-entry-sales/">Plan your first outreach</a>. Keeping calls in-house? <a href="/services/sdr-training/">Train your SDR team</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-mid-cta">
      <p><strong>Bring a target account.</strong> We’ll walk through how we’d reach the buyer and what the campaign would cost.</p>
      <a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="belkins-vs-callbox">Book a free 30-minute call <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="quote"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Ask for the same work in both quotes</h2></div>
    <dl class="bvc-grid">
      <div><dt>Put a price on the full term</dt><dd>Ask for the first invoice, every recurring fee and the cost of adding a market or language.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Assign the follow-up</dt><dd>Ask who returns calls, sends promised emails and reschedules missed meetings.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Agree on a qualified meeting</dt><dd>Write down the roles and problems that qualify. Compare total spend divided by the held meetings your team accepts.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="lp-actions">
      <a class="lp-button" href="/lead-generation-proposal-comparison/">Compare agency quotes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="lp-text-link" href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">Check meeting quality <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="questions"><div class="lp-wrap lp-faq-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Belkins vs Callbox FAQs</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-faqs">{% for faq in guide.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary><p>{{ faq.answer }}</p></details>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper bvc-sources" id="sources"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Sources and related comparisons</h2></div>
    <ul>{% for key, source in sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <p>Explore the <a href="/resources/b2b-lead-generation-pricing-report/">agency pricing report</a>, <a href="/compare/callteam-vs-belkins/">CallTeam vs Belkins</a> or <a href="/compare/callteam-vs-callbox/">CallTeam vs Callbox</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</main>
